     "status": 200,
     "firstContentMs": 1668,
     "totalMs": 2560,
     "chars": 228
    }
   ],
   "replyText": "Good, that's a complete sentence and it fits. Small tip: in speaking, we'd usually say \"he's\" instead of \"he is\" to sound natural.\n\nNow look at the phrase on the screen. Can you say the whole introduction in one go, with \"he's\"?"
