   ],
   "replyText": "Nice, that's a good sentence, but it doesn't introduce Ollie yet. Let's keep the same pattern: this is my friend Ollie, he's twelve, and then add what he likes.\n\nSo try: this is my friend Ollie, he's twelve, and he likes...?"
